IO-25: document the gutter depression heights in ft or m

The input reference gives the [STREETS] gutter depression 'a' and the
[INLET_USAGE] / [INLET_JUNCTIONS] local depression 'aLocal' in "in or mm".
Both 5.3.0 and 6.0.0 read them in ft or m, like every other street length,
and EPA's HEC-22 verification decks enter them that way (0.0833 ft and
0.025 m for a 1-inch / 25-mm depression). Correct the three lines of the
manual. This is a documentation fix; it does not touch the engines, so it
is not named _swmm530/_swmm600 and tools/run-test.sh does not apply it.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply IO-25_docs.patch

